{"id":"leben","lemma":"Leben","pos":"noun","rank":97,"glosses":["a state in which organic entities such as animals, plants and bacteria have properties like metabolism, adaptation and replication","the entirety of those who are in this state","the time period in which one is in this state; the time between birth and death"],"ipa":"/ˈleːbən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/78/De-Leben.ogg/De-Leben.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Lebens","plural":"Leben"},"formAudio":{"Lebens":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Lebens.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ihr Leben ist in Gefahr.","en":"Her life is in danger.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759976","words":[{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"danger"}]},{"text":"Leben Sie hier?","en":"Do you live here?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/29071","words":[null,{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Es ist eine Tatsache des Lebens.","en":"It's a fact of life.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"fact"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Ich will mit dir leben.","en":"I want to live with you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/711838","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},null]},{"text":"Was ist der Sinn des Lebens?","en":"What's the meaning of life?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"sense"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},null]}]}